---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | AuditVerse AI"
  description="Learn about AuditVerse AI, founded by Chartered Accountant Finalist Danish Azeem — our mission, vision, values and leadership team."
  canonical="https://www.auditverseai.com/about"
  activePage="about"
>

<section class="page-hero on-dark">
  <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--white)">About Us</span></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">About AuditVerse AI</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,54px);font-weight:800;max-width:820px;color:var(--white);line-height:1.1;">Built by auditors. Engineered by automation specialists.</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;">AuditVerse AI exists because finance teams were told to choose between compliance and speed. We build the AI systems that give them both.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight on-dark" style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
  <div class="wrap grid grid-4">
    <div class="stat reveal">
      <div class="num mono" data-count="7" data-suffix="">0</div>
      <div class="lbl">Major clients across Pakistan</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat reveal">
      <div class="num mono" data-count="35" data-suffix="+">0+</div>
      <div class="lbl">AI bots deployed in production</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat reveal">
      <div class="num mono" data-count="11" data-suffix="">0</div>
      <div class="lbl">Industries served</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat reveal">
      <div class="num mono" data-count="1" data-suffix="">0</div>
      <div class="lbl">Head office — Johar Town, Lahore</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="img-frame reveal">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560472354-b33ff0c44a43?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Finance and audit team reviewing dashboards in a modern office" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Founder's Story</div>
      <h2 class="headline">From the audit floor to building the automation the profession needed</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:18px;">Danish Azeem, a Chartered Accountancy Finalist, spent years on statutory and internal audit engagements watching the same pattern repeat: brilliant finance teams buried under manual reconciliations, spreadsheet risk, and month-end fire drills that had nothing to do with judgment and everything to do with repetitive process.</p>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">AuditVerse AI was founded on a simple thesis — audit expertise should design the controls, and artificial intelligence should run them. Not a software vendor guessing at compliance. Not an audit firm bolting on a chatbot. One team, holding both disciplines to the same standard.</p>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">Today that thesis powers finance automation for logistics groups, manufacturers, traders and service businesses across the region — with the same rigor Danish once applied to a client's trial balance now applied to every workflow we automate.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card card-dark reveal">
        <div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Our Mission</h4>
        <p>To help companies automate finance, accounting, HR, procurement, logistics and operations using artificial intelligence — while providing world-class audit and accounting services that keep automation accountable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-dark reveal">
        <div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 3a15 15 0 0 1 0 18"/><path d="M12 3a15 15 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Our Vision</h4>
        <p>A future where every growing business — not just the Fortune 500 — has access to enterprise-grade financial automation, audit assurance and real-time intelligence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-dark reveal">
        <div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="m9 13-2 8 5-3 5 3-2-8"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Our Standard</h4>
        <p>Every deliverable — bot, dashboard, or audit report — is reviewed against the same professional standard a statutory auditor would sign off on.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Core Values</div>
        <h2 class="headline">What guides every engagement, every time</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Integrity First</h4><p>We automate what is true to the numbers — never what is convenient to a deadline.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 2v3"/><path d="M15 2v3"/><path d="M9 19v3"/><path d="M15 19v3"/><path d="M2 9h3"/><path d="M2 15h3"/><path d="M19 9h3"/><path d="M19 15h3"/></svg></div><h4>Engineering Rigor</h4><p>Every bot and dashboard is tested, versioned, and documented like production software — because it is.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9"/><path d="M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg></div><h4>Client Partnership</h4><p>We embed with your finance team rather than hand over a manual and disappear.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m3 17 6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M15 7h6v6"/></svg></div><h4>Continuous Improvement</h4><p>Automation isn't a one-time project — we monitor, tune and expand it quarter over quarter.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Leadership</div>
        <h2 class="headline">The team behind AuditVerse AI</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card card-dark reveal">
        <div style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--teal-400),var(--navy-700));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#04241f;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:18px;">DA</div>
        <h4>Danish Azeem</h4>
        <p class="mono" style="color:var(--gold-400);font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:10px;">Founder &amp; CEO &middot; Chartered Accountant Finalist</p>
        <p>Leads AuditVerse AI's audit methodology and client advisory practice, translating statutory audit standards into automated controls.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-dark reveal">
        <div style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--gold-400),var(--navy-700));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#2b1c05;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:18px;">HS</div>
        <h4>Head of AI Engineering</h4>
        <p class="mono" style="color:var(--gold-400);font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:10px;">Automation &amp; Data Platform</p>
        <p>Oversees bot development, ERP integrations and the BI dashboard platform that powers every client engagement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-dark reveal">
        <div style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--white-dim),var(--navy-700));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy-950);font-size:22px;margin-bottom:18px;">HC</div>
        <h4>Head of Client Success</h4>
        <p class="mono" style="color:var(--gold-400);font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:10px;">Delivery &amp; Support</p>
        <p>Ensures every engagement has a named point of contact and a measurable 90-day automation roadmap.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Why AuditVerse AI</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Enterprise experience without enterprise bureaucracy</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg></div><h4>Enterprise Experience</h4><p>Methodologies drawn from Big-4-style audit practice, adapted for SME speed.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="m9 13-2 8 5-3 5 3-2-8"/></svg></div><h4>Certified Professionals</h4><p>CA-qualified reviewers and certified automation engineers on every engagement.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 2v3"/><path d="M15 2v3"/><path d="M9 19v3"/><path d="M15 19v3"/><path d="M2 9h3"/><path d="M2 15h3"/><path d="M19 9h3"/><path d="M19 15h3"/></svg></div><h4>AI &amp; Automation Specialists</h4><p>An in-house bench dedicated to bots, RPA and machine learning models.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div><h4>24/7 Support</h4><p>A Lahore-based team available around the clock for clients across Pakistan and beyond.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></div><h4>Secure Solutions</h4><p>Encrypted pipelines, role-based access and audit-grade data logging.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 3a15 15 0 0 1 0 18"/><path d="M12 3a15 15 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></div><h4>Cloud-Based</h4><p>Deployed on modern cloud infrastructure — accessible anywhere, anytime.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m12 2 9 5-9 5-9-5Z"/><path d="m3 12 9 5 9-5"/><path d="m3 17 9 5 9-5"/></svg></div><h4>Scalable</h4><p>From a five-person SME to a multi-entity group — the same platform grows with you.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><h4>Outcome-Focused</h4><p>We report on hours saved, errors caught and cost avoided — not just features shipped.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2 class="headline center" style="max-width:640px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Meet the team behind your automation roadmap</h2>
      <p class="lede center" style="margin-top:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Book a free consultation and speak directly with our founder-led advisory team.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions center" style="justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Book Free Consultation <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Schedule Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
